# AK_Night_City
# Low-light rescue. Opens the shadows without amplifying the noise floor, splits shadows cyan against magenta-warm highlights, and holds saturation back so neon and streetlight do not bloom out.
# Best for: Night vlogs, bars, streets, torch and firelight, indoor low light.
# Apply AFTER a D-Log M -> Rec.709 conversion, not instead of one.
TITLE "AK_Night_City"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33
DOMAIN_MIN 0.0 0.0 0.0
DOMAIN_MAX 1.0 1.0 1.0

